#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Keep the Mac awake while Claude Code, Codex, OMX, or OpenCode sessions work.

Activity is measured from persisted content timestamps, never from file mtimes
or process presence. New recent sessions are admitted while the watchdog runs;
OpenCode descendants join only an admitted seed's watched lineage.

Usage:
    claude-watchdog [IDLE_MINUTES] [--source auto|claude|codex|omx|opencode|codex-omx]
                    [--user-idle-minutes N] [--select-window SECONDS]
                    [--session-discovery live|frozen] [--poll SECONDS] [--dry-run]
                    [--profiles-file PATH]
                    [--display auto|dashboard|log] [--task-label metadata|prompt] [--no-color]
"""

